flowchart TD
    O[Scoped resource found] --> K{Requested operation}

    K -->|Create attempt| I{Intent condition}
    I -->|Confirmed| AC[PAYMENT_ALREADY_CONFIRMED 409]
    I -->|Expired| EX[PAYMENT_INTENT_EXPIRED 409]
    I -->|Other terminal| NA[PAYMENT_INTENT_NOT_ACTIVE 409]
    I -->|Created or pending| M{Method available?}
    M -->|No| MU[PAYMENT_METHOD_UNSUPPORTED 422]
    M -->|Yes| CR[Create attempt and mark pending]

    K -->|Confirm or fail| U[Conditional attempt update]
    U -->|Updated| V[Conditional intent update]
    U -->|Already same result| OK[Idempotent success]
    U -->|Different terminal result| SC[PAYMENT_STATE_CONFLICT 409]

    V -->|Updated| DONE[Commit terminal result]
    V -->|Not updated| F{Reload intent state}
    F -->|Confirmed| AC
    F -->|Expired| EX
    F -->|Other inactive| NA

    SC --> RB[Transaction rollback]
    AC --> RB
    EX --> RB
    NA --> RB
